 <div class="partner-logo"><img src="/img/partners/twin3.jpg" alt="Twin3"><span>Twin3</span></div>
 <div class="partner-logo"><img src="/img/partners/tuition.jpg" alt="Tuition Onchain"><span>Tuition Onchain</span></div>
